# Ulavan Connect — Full Architecture Migration Walkthrough (Phases 1–6)

## Executive Summary
Ulavan Connect has completed its full architectural transition from a monolithic prototype into a resilient, event-driven, zero-disk microservice ecosystem on **Azure Container Apps (ACA)**. The entire system is validated by **183 automated tests** passing with 100% green status.

```
                  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                  │                 Farmer (WhatsApp/Voice)                 │
                  └────────────┬───────────────────────────────▲────────────┘
                               │ HTTPS Webhook                 │ Meta/Twilio
                               ▼                               │ Proactive
                  ┌─────────────────────────┐                  │ Outbound
                  │     uzhavan-gateway     │                  │
                  │   (Stateless Ingress)   │                  │
                  └────────────┬────────────┘                  │
                               │ Fast Durability (< 500ms)     │
                               ▼                               │
                  ┌─────────────────────────┐                  │
                  │   Azure Blob Storage    │                  │
                  │  (events/, inbox/, ...) │                  │
                  └────────────┬────────────┘                  │
                               │ 60s Exclusive Lease           │
                               ▼                               │
                  ┌─────────────────────────┐                  │
                  │     uzhavan-worker      │──────────────────┘
                  │  (Private Orchestrator) │
                  └─────────────────────────┘
```

