## Complete Phase Breakdown & Deliverables

### Phase 1: Canonical Data Contracts & Pure Decision Engine
- **Data Contracts ([`src/contracts/v1/`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/contracts/v1/))**: Immutable, versioned schemas (`events.py`, `intelligence.py`, `market.py`, `decision.py`, `language.py`).
- **Pure Decision Engine ([`src/decision_engine/engine.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/decision_engine/engine.py))**: Zero-IO domain module with canonical policy thresholds:
  - $\text{SELL}: \text{offer\_ratio} \ge 0.90$
  - $\text{NEGOTIATE}: 0.80 \le \text{offer\_ratio} < 0.90$
  - $\text{HOLD}: \text{offer\_ratio} < 0.80$
  - $\text{WAIT}$: Evidence Gate failures (stale data, high volatility $> 15\%$, low confidence $< 0.60$).
- **Gateway Security ([`src/gateway/security/`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/gateway/security/))**: HMAC verification for Meta (`X-Hub-Signature-256`) and Twilio (`X-Twilio-Signature`).

### Phase 2: Scheduled Mandi Ingestion & Snapshot Store
- **Storage Layout ([`src/data/storage/blob_repo.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/data/storage/blob_repo.py))**: Standardized Blob paths for raw (`market/raw/`), curated (`market/curated/`), and snapshots (`market/snapshots/`).
- **Scheduled Ingestion Runner ([`src/data/ingestion/`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/data/ingestion/))**: Pulls official mandi data from `data.gov.in` with quarantine routing for anomalies.
- **Snapshot Publisher & Reader ([`src/data/snapshots/`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/data/snapshots/), [`src/data/reader.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/data/reader.py))**: Precomputes rolling 7-day and 30-day metrics, enabling sub-50ms snapshot retrieval during worker execution.

### Phase 3: Asynchronous Gateway & Ingress Durability
- **Durable Event Store ([`src/platform/storage/event_store.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/platform/storage/event_store.py))**: Writes incoming messages to immutable `events/` and backlog `inbox/`.
- **FastAPI Ingress Endpoints ([`src/gateway/routes/`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/gateway/routes/))**: Stateless routes acknowledging Meta and Twilio webhooks in $< 500\text{ms}$.
- **Rate Limiting & Health Probes ([`src/gateway/middleware/rate_limit.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/gateway/middleware/rate_limit.py), [`src/gateway/routes/health.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/gateway/routes/health.py))**: Sliding-window rate limiter, `/api/v1/health/live` (liveness), and `/api/v1/health/ready` (storage readiness).

### Phase 4: Private Worker Orchestrator, Multimodal AI & Language/TTS
- **Work Lease Manager ([`src/worker/lease_manager.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/worker/lease_manager.py))**: Acquires exclusive 60s blob leases on `inbox/` items, manages heartbeat renewals, clean purges, and dead-letter queue routing.
- **Multimodal Extraction & Validation ([`src/intelligence/`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/intelligence/))**: Single-hop extraction via Gemini 3.5 Flash Lite streaming audio directly to/from Blob storage (zero local disk files), paired with deterministic Tamil dialect alias normalization.
- **Resilient Language Layer & TTS ([`src/language/`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/language/))**: Rural-first Tamil phrasing citing mandi dates, Edge TTS streaming MP3 directly to `media/outbound/` with 1-hour SAS URLs and automatic `TEXT_ONLY` fallback.
- **Worker Pipeline ([`src/worker/pipeline.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/worker/pipeline.py))**: Orchestrates extraction, clarification branching, snapshot lookup, pure decision evaluation, and localized response rendering.

### Phase 5: Outbound Delivery, Meta WhatsApp Cloud API & Lifecycle Handlers
- **Meta WhatsApp Cloud Client ([`src/channels/meta/client.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/channels/meta/client.py))**: Dual dispatch (text + voice note SAS URL), 24h customer service window template switching, rate-limit backoff, and idempotency headers.
- **Twilio REST Outbound Client ([`src/channels/twilio/client.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/channels/twilio/client.py))**: Proactive asynchronous WhatsApp delivery.
- **Delivery Status Webhooks ([`src/gateway/routes/status.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/gateway/routes/status.py))**: Webhooks tracking provider lifecycle transitions (`sent` $\rightarrow$ `delivered` $\rightarrow$ `read` $\rightarrow$ `failed`).
- **Scheduled Reconciliation Job ([`src/worker/jobs/reconciliation.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/worker/jobs/reconciliation.py))**: Recovers orphaned `inbox/` items (> 10m old) and manages dead-letter routing after 3 retries.

### Phase 6: Production Hardening, Azure Container Apps & Day-2 Operations
- **Distributed Telemetry & PII Redaction ([`src/platform/telemetry/`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/platform/telemetry/))**: Automated masking of farmer phone numbers (`+919876543210` $\rightarrow$ `+91XXXXXX3210`), credential redaction, binary buffer truncation, and correlation ID propagation.
- **Operator Replay Tooling ([`src/tools/replay.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/tools/replay.py))**: CLI and library to re-enqueue messages from `work/dead-letter/` or `events/` back into `inbox/` with auditable metadata (`replayed_by`, `reason`).
- **Scheduled Maintenance Jobs ([`src/worker/jobs/cleanup.py`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/src/worker/jobs/cleanup.py))**: Nightly cleanup of audio blobs older than 30 days and expired active lease locks.
- **Declarative ACA Manifests ([`deploy/azure/`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/deploy/azure/))**: Bicep and YAML templates for ACA Environment, `uzhavan-gateway` (public HTTPS, `minReplicas = 1`, `readOnlyRootFilesystem: true`, probes, HTTP scaling), `uzhavan-worker`, and Container Apps Jobs.
- **Deployment & Replay Runbook ([`docs/operations/DEPLOYMENT_AND_REPLAY.md`](file:///e:/Program%20Files/vs%20code/Decillium_farmerProduct/docs/operations/DEPLOYMENT_AND_REPLAY.md))**: Complete operational instructions for deployment, RBAC, replay, and alerting.

